
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Doctor Application Update</title>
</head>

<body style="
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background-color: #f4f6f8;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
">

    <div style="
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    ">

        <!-- Header -->
        <div style="
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            background-color: #dc2626;
            color: #ffffff;
        ">
            <div style="
                width: 60px;
                height: 60px;
                margin: 0 auto 15px;
                background-color: #ffffff;
                color: #dc2626;
                border-radius: 50%;
                font-size: 34px;
                line-height: 60px;
            ">
                !
            </div>

            <h1 style="
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 26px;
            ">
                Application Update
            </h1>
        </div>

        <!-- Content -->
        <div style="padding: 35px 30px;">

            <h2 style="
                margin-top: 0;
                color: #111827;
                font-size: 22px;
            ">
                Hello Dr. <%= name %>,
            </h2>

            <p style="
                color: #4b5563;
                font-size: 16px;
                line-height: 1.7;
            ">
                Thank you for your interest in joining our healthcare
                platform as a doctor.
            </p>

            <div style="
                margin: 25px 0;
                padding: 20px;
                background-color: #fef2f2;
                border-radius: 8px;
                border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;
            ">
                <p style="
                    margin: 0;
                    color: #991b1b;
                    font-size: 15px;
                    line-height: 1.6;
                ">
                    After carefully reviewing your application and
                    submitted information, we regret to inform you that
                    your application has not been approved at this time.
                </p>
            </div>

            <p style="
                color: #4b5563;
                font-size: 16px;
                line-height: 1.7;
            ">
                We appreciate the time and effort you put into your
                application. You may review your information and apply
                again in the future if applications are reopened.
            </p>

            <p style="
                color: #4b5563;
                font-size: 16px;
                line-height: 1.7;
            ">
                If you believe this decision was made in error or you
                need further clarification, please contact our support
                team.
            </p>

            <p style="
                margin-bottom: 0;
                color: #111827;
                font-size: 16px;
            ">
                Best regards,<br>
                <strong>Healthcare Team</strong>
            </p>

        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div style="
            padding: 20px 30px;
            background-color: #f9fafb;
            text-align: center;
        ">
            <p style="
                margin: 0;
                color: #9ca3af;
                font-size: 12px;
                line-height: 1.5;
            ">
                This is an automated email. Please do not reply to this email.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
